  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then, at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,</p>"
