  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given equation can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>where,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math></p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
